From e33d130f8ce72cbf62f458e5fcfaa68ac560ad77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexy Khrabrov <deliverable@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:32:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] S0 tiered accounting: staging tiers, projection build cost,
 sampler steps

Local, unpushed, for review. Nutmeg's stage receipt reports what each part
admitted (sort permutation, keys, sorted copy, fill, normalized, retained,
sort seconds, sorted flag); each projection build records its seconds and
admitted bytes and the diagnostics expose them; the sampler counts open
descriptors and walks watched directories, with per-step peaks; the cell
times staging, projectionStats and the kernel as separate steps and checks
that the kernel reused the projection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
